  "technical_impact": "A <meter>, <progress> or an element with role=\"meter\" or role=\"progressbar\" has no accessible name from a <label>, aria-label, aria-labelledby or title, so a screen reader announces only the role and the value; a gauge is non-text content, and its name is the text alternative that says what is measured.",
