      "applicability": "Elements in the accessibility tree with the role meter or progressbar: native <meter> and <progress>, and elements with role=\"meter\" or role=\"progressbar\".",
      "expectation": "Fails when the computed name is empty: a gauge is non-text content, and its name is the text\nalternative that says what is measured. A <label for>, aria-label, aria-labelledby or title\npasses. The value alone (aria-valuenow, the element's content) is no name. Hidden subtrees are\nout of scope.",
